## Internal Module Structure

The standard directory structure of a module is detailed in the
section [Module Directory Structure](../module-installation/directory-structure.md).

Key elements: * **[`_i/`](../module-installation/directory-structure.md#_i-metadata)**: Installation metadata (see [Installation Metadata](../module-installation/installation-meta-files.md) and [Installation File Format](./installation-format.md)).
* **[`page.json`](../module-installation/directory-structure.md#pagejson)**: Main file describing the [UI structure](../core-concepts/template-schema.md) of the page/module.
* **[`templates/`](../module-installation/directory-structure.md#templates)**: JSON templates for UI components (see [Component Syntax](../core-concepts/component-syntax.md)).
* **[`sections/`](../module-installation/directory-structure.md#sections)**: (Often used in Landing Pages) Reusable blocks/sections of the page, typically included using the [`include` operation](../commands-and-operations/server-operations-reference.md#include).
* **[`actions/`](../module-installation/directory-structure.md#actions)**: Definitions of [Server Actions](../core-concepts/module-actions.md) (sequences of [server commands](../commands-and-operations/server-actions-reference.md)) invoked via `call` or client `sendData` hooks.
* **[`data/`](../module-installation/directory-structure.md#data)**: Initial or static data for the module (see [`Data` Support Class](../../../core/AiRudeDepot/Support/Data.md)).
* **[`validations/`](../module-installation/directory-structure.md#validations)**: Validation rules, often used with [`FormManager`](../../resources/managers/form/formManager.md).

## Component Interaction

Interaction between components and with the system is handled via: * **Command System (Server)**: For executing server-side logic (see [Server Actions Reference](../commands-and-operations/server-actions-reference.md) and [Server Operations Reference](../commands-and-operations/server-operations-reference.md)), typically initiated via `customHooks` using `sendData`.
* **Client Actions (`customHooks`)**: For simple client-side UI effects and initiating server requests (see [UI Commands Reference](../commands-and-operations/ui-documentation.md) and `ActionManager` within [Global Managers](../core-concepts/managers.md)).
* **Global Managers (`hub`)**: For accessing shared services and state (see [`HubManager`](../../resources/managers/HubManager.md) and [Global Managers List](../core-concepts/managers.md)).
* **Event Bus (`hub.notifyManager`)**: For loose coupling between components/managers (see `NotifyManager` within [Global Managers](../core-concepts/managers.md)).

